= Starting this blog

/Posted August 22, 2026/

I set up this space to keep notes on what I am reading and building --- mostly
federated learning and unlearning, with the occasional detour into edge systems.

== Why write things down

Papers report the result that worked. The reasoning that got there, and the
attempts that did not, usually go unrecorded. This is where I keep that part.

== What to expect

Short posts: a paper I found useful, a derivation I had to work through twice,
or a bug that cost me a day.
